---
description: Require the Muses skill chain for UI work.
globs: "**/*.{css,scss,html,tsx,jsx,vue,svelte}"
alwaysApply: false
---

For a task that changes a user-facing interface, follow the task manifest's UI
skill chain: HCI foundations (`.opencode/skills/` HCI skills) for affordances, feedback, and accessibility;
Picasso for tokens and visual contract; Escher for real data contracts; and Vermeer for
implementation and 6 interactive states. Do not invent backend responses; record missing
fields in the task artifact.
